;
; 19 to 22 March, 2009:
;   added flexible bribes;
;   added higher paying jobs.
;
; 6 April, 2009:
;   added reverse status.
;
; 13 to 15 April, 2009:
;   added hypercruise and cruise_on.
;
; 6 May, 2009:
;   added tl_decel;
;   don't assume Server & Content are the same version (Discovery problem).
;
; 11 July, 2009:
;   fixed Content version check (jobs wasn't working).
;
; 30 July, 2009:
;   use FNSTSW;
;   added save in space.
;
; 25 August, 2009:
;   added test_auto_cm;
;   used the (almost) correct bribe value, rounding it like Freelancer.
